{"title": "Half Plate Armour +1", "pageid": 15102, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Half_Plate_Armour_+1", "categories": ["Medium Armour", "Uncommon items", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/c/c0/Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Half Plate Armour +1 image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Half_Plate_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Half Plate Armour +1</span></a></b> is a uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Medium_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium Armour</a> that reduces <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span> damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/imag